Alih-alih menjelajahi

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:22.790
co-pilot sendiri,

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:23.770
mereka menerapkan

00:16:23.770 --> 00:16:24.890
kerangga kerja bersama HR,

00:16:25.010 --> 00:16:25.690
perintah terstruktur,

